{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01和尤其只有18秒的S05中，未标“到时出现”的感受短语仍然比较密集，扫读不如X左右分栏来得轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】直接凸显每段叙事的关键转折，感受又能跟随音乐节点出现，水波、船身、失重到停稳的意象形成了贯穿始终的联系，情绪变化也因此更具体、更有层次。X的完整句子在交代人物动机和因果关系上更省力，左右分栏也方便快速浏览，但右侧感受词相对概括，音乐细节与细腻程度不及Y。总体而言，Y虽然有局部扫读负担，却更能让观众同时感受到人物心理、音乐变化和整段情绪的发展。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3b6afd9f-30f4-4c59-a6ae-7f43b07afa36", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T181526441423Z", "elapsed_seconds": 97.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:17:03.671233+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6ce965706b204a03c105d61e726ec3304dff4d6e40773a4686f6f2bf8f681355", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g